# A Zone indexer beside the sequencer as a systemd user service (systemctl --user). Install
# and operation: README.md, "As a service". Reads the same .env,
# then indexer.env, which overrides MODE, DATA_DIR and HTTP_ADDR.

[Unit]
Description=RLN Membership Zone indexer
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
WorkingDirectory=%h/logos-rln-membership-zone
EnvironmentFile=%h/logos-rln-membership-zone/.env
EnvironmentFile=%h/logos-rln-membership-zone/systemd/indexer.env
Environment=RUST_LOG=warn,zone=info,logos_blockchain=info
ExecStart=%h/logos-rln-membership-zone/target/release/zone
# The node stops on SIGINT (Ctrl-C) and closes its store; stop it the same way.
KillSignal=SIGINT
TimeoutStopSec=30
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=30

[Install]
WantedBy=default.target
